<section class="ramadan-knowledge" id="ramadan-guide" aria-labelledby="ramadan-knowledge-heading">
 <h2 id="ramadan-knowledge-heading">Ramadan timetables: the complete planning guide</h2>
 <p>A useful Ramadan calendar should explain <em>which days</em> it covers, <em>which location and method</em> its dawn and sunset times use, and <em>what still needs local confirmation</em>. This guide covers the calendar, daily fasting times, printable exports, seasonal differences and the sources behind the guidance.</p>
